        "text_Vpcx7b": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Mount solar modules faster, cheaper, and smarter with the S-5!® PVKIT® — the original rail-less solar mounting solution for metal roofs. By using the roof's existing seams or ribs as the mounting structure, PVKIT eliminates the need for bulky rails, cutting your material costs, installation time, and project headaches. Whether you're working on standing seam or exposed-fastened metal roofs, PVKIT delivers a streamlined, lightweight system that’s engineered for speed, strength, and simplicity.</p>",
